Read the spike tasks of `{{ plan }}-spikes` and the draft plan `{{ plan }}`, and write the
spike brief a person approves before any spike runs: exactly one document of `{{ plan }}`
with the native id `{{ native }}-spike-brief`, rendered from the `spike-brief` template as
`onepipeline template resolve spike-brief --json` resolves it, with one entry per spike task,
by its node id.

## Acceptance criteria

- `{{ plan }}` holds the document `{{ native }}-spike-brief`, rendered from the `spike-brief` template, with one question and use for each spike task of `{{ plan }}-spikes` and no other.

## Additional info

This dispatch writes only to the plan store, which is gitignored: it commits nothing and
leaves the checkout on its base branch.
